# ==============================================================================
# ConceptCast Monorepo Configuration Template
# ==============================================================================

# --- Secret Management (Infisical) ---
# Secrets are managed via Infisical. To use them:
# 1. Install Infisical CLI: https://infisical.com/docs/cli/usage
# 2. Run 'infisical login'
# 3. Run the application via 'infisical run -- pnpm dev'
#
# Note: Secrets are stored in the '/ai' folder in Infisical (Dev).

# --- Local Fallbacks ---
# These are used if Infisical is not configured.
# Uncomment and set these to use local values instead of Infisical.

# [Backend] AI Provider Keys
# NANO_API_KEY=your_nano_api_key
# CONTEXT7_API_KEY=your_context7_api_key
